{
  "reasoning": "玩家当前位于地母神庙，且与女神官（priestess）的关系已提升至‘熟人’（acquaintance）。这是深化关系并提供初期引导的最佳时机。我将安排女神官主动打招呼，并提供基础的治疗服务。同时，通过神庙里的圣女（temple_matron）提供关于哥布林杀手的线索，引导玩家完成‘踏入边境’里程碑的后续目标。此外，发布一个简单的采集任务和一则关于哥布林的公告，以丰富世界观并提供升级所需的经验值。",
  "directives": [
    {
      "kind": "direct_npc",
      "payload": {
        "npc_id": "priestess",
        "directive": {
          "kind": "talk",
          "topic": "神庙的日常与对冒险者的敬意"
        },
        "priority": "high"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "assign_service",
      "payload": {
        "npc_id": "priestess",
        "service_id": "mother_earth_healing",
        "label": "地母神的轻声祈祷（微量治疗）",
        "price": 0,
        "effects": [{"type": "restore_hp", "amount": 20}]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "fill_location",
      "payload": {
        "area_id": "frontier_town",
        "location_id": "mother_earth_temple",
        "room_id": "herb_garden",
        "interactables": [
          {
            "id": "sacred_herbs",
            "name": "圣洁药草",
            "description": "神庙后花园培育的药草，叶片上带着淡淡的微光。",
            "type": "inspect",
            "tags": ["quest_item"],
            "functional": {
              "type": "investigate_clue",
              "params": {
                "clue_id": "clue_gather_herbs",
                "options": [
                  {"id": "gather", "label": "小心采摘"},
                  {"id": "examine", "label": "观察药草品质"}
                ],
                "outcomes": {
                  "gather": {"on_pass": [{"type": "set_flag", "params": {"key": "herbs_gathered", "value": true}}]}
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "create_quest",
      "payload": {
        "quest_id": "dq_temple_herbs",
        "title": "地母神的药草请求",
        "summary": "女神官需要一些新鲜的圣洁药草来制作伤药。",
        "status": "available",
        "objectives": [
          {
            "description": "在神庙后花园采集圣洁药草",
            "condition": {"type": "flag_set", "params": {"key": "herbs_gathered", "value": true}}
          },
          {
            "description": "将药草交给女神官",
            "condition": {"type": "npc_talked", "params": {"npc_id": "priestess"}}
          }
        ],
        "rewards": {"xp": 300, "gold": 40}
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "direct_npc",
      "payload": {
        "npc_id": "temple_matron",
        "directive": {
          "kind": "inform",
          "topic": "公会里那位总是沉默寡言、穿着破烂铠甲的奇特冒险者"
        },
        "priority": "medium"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "publish_bulletin",
      "payload": {
        "board_id": "notice_board",
        "area_id": "frontier_town",
        "title": "【警告】近期哥布林活动频繁",
        "content": "近日边境附近哥布林巢穴有扩张迹象，请单身冒险者切勿深入密林。若有发现大规模踪迹，请速报公会。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "story_facts": [
    {"subject": "priestess", "relation": "has_opinion_of", "object": "player"},
    {"subject": "player", "relation": "knows_about", "object": "dq_temple_herbs"},
    {"subject": "temple_matron", "relation": "interacted_with", "object": "player"}
  ],
  "strategy_notes": "NPC关系：priestess=acquaintance(10/10)，已开启基础服务。任务：布置了第一个采集任务dq_temple_herbs，利用神庙花园空间。引导：通过temple_matron引导玩家去公会找goblin_slayer。下次若玩家移动到tavern或adventurer_guild，将触发与GS的初次互动。",
  "next_trigger_hint": "player_moves_or_interacts"
}

{
  "reasoning": "玩家已进入酒馆，且女神官在队。这正是完成里程碑目标‘与哥布林杀手交谈’的最佳契机。我将安排哥布林杀手及其小队成员（妖精弓手）主动引起玩家注意。同时，作为酒馆场景，酒馆老板应提供基础服务和补给。为了缓解长期停滞（116 ticks），我将通过NPC主动搭话来强力引导剧情进展。",
  "directives": [
    {
      "kind": "direct_npc",
      "payload": {
        "npc_id": "goblin_slayer",
        "directive": {
          "kind": "react",
          "topic": "打量玩家及其身后的女神官，简短地提到哥布林"
        },
        "priority": "high"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "direct_npc",
      "payload": {
        "npc_id": "high_elf_archer",
        "directive": {
          "kind": "approach",
          "topic": "对玩家带着女神官冒险感到好奇，并邀请玩家坐下"
        },
        "priority": "medium"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "assign_service",
      "payload": {
        "npc_id": "tavern_keeper",
        "service_id": "tavern_meal",
        "label": "酒馆炖菜与黑面包",
        "price": 10,
        "effects": [
          {
            "type": "restore_hp",
            "amount": 30
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "create_rumor",
      "payload": {
        "text": "听说西南方的村庄已经几天没有消息传来了，公会正在观察那里的情况。",
        "area_id": "frontier_town",
        "spread_range": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "curate_shop",
      "payload": {
        "npc_id": "tavern_keeper",
        "add_items": [
          {
            "item_id": "portable_ration",
            "count": 5
          },
          {
            "item_id": "ale_mug",
            "count": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "direct_npc",
      "payload": {
        "npc_id": "priestess",
        "directive": {
          "kind": "talk",
          "topic": "向玩家低声介绍角落里那支著名的‘白银等级’小队"
        },
        "priority": "low"
      }
    }
  ],
  "story_facts": [
    {
      "subject": "player",
      "relation": "interacted_with",
      "object": "goblin_slayer"
    },
    {
      "subject": "high_elf_archer",
      "relation": "has_opinion_of",
      "object": "player"
    },
    {
      "subject": "player",
      "relation": "knows_about",
      "object": "frontier_town_rumor_1"
    }
  ],
  "strategy_notes": "NPC关系：女神官在队，且正与GS小队产生交集。目标：引导玩家完成与GS的对话以推进里程碑。环境：酒馆填充了饮食服务和物资。下一步：一旦玩家与GS对话完成，将触发前往公会领取正式任务的剧情。",
  "next_trigger_hint": "player_talks_to_goblin_slayer"
}

{
  "reasoning": "里程碑已推进至 'ms_growing_darkness'。玩家目前正在公会大厅，我将通过柜台小姐正式发布调查任务，并安排铁匠来到公会现场进行‘抱怨’以强化叙事冲突。为了引导玩家前往下一个地点（古代遗迹），我将设置一个包含调查和战斗的完整任务链，并在此之前通过北门守备官提供线索。",
  "directives": [
    {
      "kind": "direct_npc",
      "payload": {
        "npc_id": "guild_girl",
        "directive": {
          "kind": "talk",
          "topic": "关于补给车队失踪以及古代遗迹发现大量哥布林踪迹的紧急委托"
        },
        "priority": "high"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "modify_location",
      "payload": {
        "npc_id": "blacksmith",
        "area_id": "frontier_town",
        "location_id": "adventurer_guild"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "direct_npc",
      "payload": {
        "npc_id": "blacksmith",
        "directive": {
          "kind": "react",
          "topic": "愤怒地质问公会为何还没处理掉那些拦截商道的哥布林"
        },
        "priority": "medium"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "create_quest",
      "payload": {
        "quest_id": "dq_investigate_ruins",
        "title": "失踪的车队与古代遗迹",
        "summary": "铁匠的车队在前往古代遗迹的必经之路上失踪了，公会怀疑与那里的哥布林活动有关。",
        "status": "available",
        "objectives": [
          {
            "description": "向北门守备长询问最近的发现",
            "condition": {
              "type": "npc_talked",
              "params": {
                "npc_id": "north_gate_warden"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "description": "前往古代遗迹进行调查",
            "condition": {
              "type": "location_visited",
              "params": {
                "area_id": "ancient_ruins",
                "location_id": "ruins_entrance"
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "rewards": {
          "xp": 500,
          "gold": 150
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "direct_npc",
      "payload": {
        "npc_id": "goblin_slayer",
        "directive": {
          "kind": "talk",
          "topic": "冷静地提醒玩家，这些哥布林不是在游荡，而是在驻守"
        },
        "priority": "medium"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "plant_environmental",
      "payload": {
        "area_id": "frontier_town",
        "location_id": "north_gate",
        "label": "北门路障",
        "description": "为了应对频繁的袭击，城门处临时增设了拒马，守卫们神色紧张。",
        "dc": 10
      }
    }
  ],
  "story_facts": [
    {
      "subject": "blacksmith",
      "relation": "has_opinion_of",
      "object": "adventure_guild"
    },
    {
      "subject": "player",
      "relation": "knows_about",
      "object": "dq_investigate_ruins"
    },
    {
      "subject": "goblin_slayer",
      "relation": "interacted_with",
      "object": "player"
    }
  ],
  "strategy_notes": "里程碑转换：从'踏入边境'转向'黑暗滋生'。引导：通过将铁匠移至公会强化代入感，并发布主线任务引导玩家前往古代遗迹。战斗准备：后续将会在古代遗迹放置具体遭遇。NPC动态：GS开始提供更专业的哥布林知识指导。",
  "next_trigger_hint": "player_talks_to_guild_girl_or_moves_to_north_gate"
}

{
  "reasoning": "玩家已在公会完成初步对话，里程碑 'ms_growing_darkness' 正在推进。由于上轮将铁匠移至公会的指令执行受阻，且玩家正准备前往北门调查车队失踪案，我将重点转向‘北门’场景的布置，并利用新结识的妖精弓手（high_elf_archer）增加社交深度。同时，为即将到来的‘古代遗迹’区域预先布置线索和遭遇，确保冒险链条完整。",
  "directives": [
    {
      "kind": "direct_npc",
      "payload": {
        "npc_id": "high_elf_archer",
        "directive": {
          "kind": "talk",
          "topic": "对比哥布林讨伐与森林探险，并嘲笑矮人道士的酒量"
        },
        "priority": "medium"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "fill_location",
      "payload": {
        "area_id": "frontier_town",
        "location_id": "north_gate",
        "interactables": [
          {
            "id": "clue_broken_wagon",
            "name": "损毁的货运马车",
            "description": "铁匠提到的那辆车就翻倒在路基下，车厢上有明显的斧凿痕迹和绿色的粘液。",
            "type": "inspect",
            "tags": ["clue"],
            "functional": {
              "type": "investigate_clue",
              "params": {
                "clue_id": "clue_broken_wagon",
                "options": [
                  {"id": "check_cargo", "label": "检查货物去向"},
                  {"id": "check_tracks", "label": "搜寻袭击者的脚印"}
                ],
                "outcomes": {
                  "check_tracks": {"on_pass": [{"type": "set_flag", "params": {"key": "ruins_trail_found", "value": true}}]}
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "direct_npc",
      "payload": {
        "npc_id": "north_gate_warden",
        "directive": {
          "kind": "inform",
          "topic": "最近在林道发现的大规模哥布林行军痕迹，指向古代遗迹方向"
        },
        "priority": "high"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "fill_area",
      "payload": {
        "area_id": "ancient_ruins",
        "id": "ruins_exterior",
        "label": "遗迹外围",
        "description": "被藤蔓缠绕的石柱倾倒在泥土中，阴影里似乎有眼睛在窥视。",
        "locked": false
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "plant_encounter",
      "payload": {
        "area_id": "ancient_ruins",
        "sub_area_id": "ruins_exterior",
        "monster_ids": ["goblin", "goblin", "goblin_scout"],
        "threat_level": "moderate",
        "description": "守在遗迹入口处的哥布林哨兵"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "assign_capability",
      "payload": {
        "npc_id": "guild_quartermaster",
        "capability_id": "basic_gear_repair",
        "instruction": "当玩家装备受损时，提供基础的修理指导和磨刀石",
        "functional": "trade_browse"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "update_quest",
      "payload": {
        "quest_id": "dq_investigate_ruins",
        "current_step": "前往北门调查",
        "next_steps": ["追踪脚印前往古代遗迹"],
        "hints": ["北门守备长可能掌握着第一手目击情报。"]
      }
    }
  ],
  "story_facts": [
    {"subject": "high_elf_archer", "relation": "knows_about", "object": "player"},
    {"subject": "north_gate_warden", "relation": "interacted_with", "object": "player"},
    {"subject": "ancient_ruins", "relation": "related_to", "object": "dq_investigate_ruins"}
  ],
  "strategy_notes": "目标引导：通过任务更新和NPC对话引导玩家前往北门。场景布置：在北门放置了马车残骸作为线索入口，连接至古代遗迹。战斗预告：在古代遗迹入口布置了第一波战斗。NPC互动：利用妖精弓手的‘熟人’阶段提供社交反馈，并激活补给官的交易功能以应对战斗损耗。",
  "next_trigger_hint": "player_arrives_at_north_gate"
}

{
